    presentfuture: { t: "Present State vs Future State", b: "I map the present state of an organization, business unit, or stakeholder journey to design the future state. The global blueprinting effort at Bayer existed to identify the present state of our tech stack and operational interactions and then make recommendations for future state: we delivered a present state map and a future state map. I did the same at Dryland Revival, mapping our current processes and then identifying new product and service opportunities for our customers and better ways of working for our teams.", s: "10+ years experience" },
