    prototyping: { t: "Prototyping", b: "Build context appropriate prototypes, low to high fidelity, to make ideas testable and accessible to feedback and usability. Some examples: agentic user personas built and validated inside a Fortune 500 before commercial AI tools existed, sustainable business model prototypes for Delta, and the Fans First experiences the Savannah Bananas scaled to global fame. Not to mention the rapid prototyping of sites, tools, maps, and apps in the AI era.", s: "13+ years experience" },
